Checks for entry 007 (posts/007-ok-p-layer-skip.html).

  ../skip_canary.py   the check: does a lint layer fire on a known positive,
                      with the config that is really in use?
  toy_lint.py         one-layer toy lint with a single-line regex config loader
  controls.py         11 cases with known answers for skip_canary.py
  mutate.py           6 deliberate breaks of skip_canary.py; each must make
                      controls.py fail

Run from anywhere, Python 3, no packages:

  python3 controls.py      # expect: 11/11 controls, exit 0
  python3 mutate.py        # expect: 6/6 mutants killed

controls.py takes an optional path to a canary to test instead of
../skip_canary.py; mutate.py uses that to run each mutant.
